<br />
<strong>Why was my bag lost/not loaded?</strong><br />
Baggage can be delayed for multiple reasons such as, operational issues, weight and balance requirements, weather, enhanced security checks or Airport infrastructure.&nbsp; Due to these complexities, we have not been able to pinpoint the specific reason in your case.<br />
<br />
<strong>Emergency expenses for customers away from home</strong><br />
<br />
We know that when our customers are away from home, they might need to spend on extra expenses and may not have all the comforts and clothing they'd normally have - this means they’re eligible to claim emergency expenses.<br />
<br />
However, since your bag was delayed at your home port, we're unable to offer emergency expenses at this time.&nbsp;To make a claim for delayed baggage , please refer to our website. <a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/baggage/delayed-lost-damaged">Delayed, lost or damaged baggage</a><br />
